            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/order/update/{{orderId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "order", "update", "{{orderId}}"]
            },
            "description": "`order_status` string: **in-progress** | **completed** | **cancelled** | **refunded** (any transition allowed). Syncs to non-terminal line items. `is_paid` propagates to non-cancelled/refunded lines."
          },
          "response": []
        },
